        "heading": "HHaven Wellness & Social Club, built here in Nebraska.",
        "text": "<p>I'm building a place where modern medicine and ancient practices meet. Providers who listen, a movement studio, a sauna, a café, and a greenhouse and farm. Somewhere you come because you want to be there.</p><p>Right now I'm looking for land. If you know someone with acreage, I'd love to hear from you.</p>",
